WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.473
Read the core as cooperating blocks.

2
00:00:02.473 --> 00:00:06.662
The frontend fetches instructions and decode interprets them.

3
00:00:06.662 --> 00:00:13.393
Issue checks dependencies and resource availability, while the scoreboard tracks outstanding work.

4
00:00:13.393 --> 00:00:18.888
Execution units return results, and commit updates architectural state in order.

5
00:00:18.888 --> 00:00:23.490
Caches, control registers and exception handling support this path.

6
00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:26.855
Address translation depends on the configuration.

7
00:00:26.855 --> 00:00:33.380
These four groups are a reading map, not four pipeline stages or a cycle-accurate timing model.

